From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:13:45 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mshtml: ~180 attribute properties of img, input, area, table,
 td, tr, iframe, textarea, object and others (3017)

Many properties of the HTML element interfaces are plain reflections of an
attribute and returned E_NOTIMPL: useMap, hspace, vspace, border, lowsrc of
IHTMLImgElement; alt, align, width, height of IHTMLInputElement; shape, coords,
target, alt, noHref and tabIndex of IHTMLAreaElement; border, rules, cols,
background and the border colors of IHTMLTable, IHTMLTableCell and
IHTMLTableRow; the body margins; frame border, spacing and noResize; iframe
src, longDesc, frameBorder, hspace, vspace and align; textarea cols, rows, wrap,
name and disabled; object and embed align, code, codeBase, type, data, src,
width, height, units and others; script htmlFor and event; meta url and so on.

They now read and write the attribute with new helpers for strings, variants,
numbers and boolean attributes, which return 0, an empty string or false for a
missing attribute.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XZFS4SPPzeH5d2c1MuzqCS

